-- 500 more anime cards and the plain mistakes in the tiers, as the owners
-- asked on 2026-11-21.
--
-- The cards are the 500 characters AniList loves best after those already
-- in the catalog (ranks 1800 to about 2400, 855 to 617 favourites), each
-- with a real picture of its own (none AniList's default face or under
-- 15 KB), as Common cards with cards.Card's numbers.
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

-- Characters that anime fans at large know, left Common or Rare because
-- AniList's votes for them are few, rise one or two tiers, with the numbers
-- cards.CardOf gives that tier: to Epic Hashirama Senju, Muzan Kibutsuji,
-- Whitebeard, Cell, Broly, Yoriichi, Cloud Strife, Netero, Kurama (Naruto),
-- Akaza, Doflamingo, Ulquiorra, Archer, Gohan, Piccolo, Might Guy and Tobi
-- from Common, and Gilgamesh, Pain, Kenpachi and Garou from Rare; to Rare
-- 22 others, such as Boa Hancock, Grimmjow, Trunks, Byakuya, Hitsugaya,
-- Tsunade, Jinbe, Katakuri, Jonathan Joestar, Iskandar, Annie and Zeke. The
-- sets the owners raised by hand (Record of Ragnarok, the Seven Deadly
-- Sins, Firefly Wedding) stay as they are.
UPDATE card_catalog c SET rarity = v.rarity, attack = v.attack, health = v.health, value = v.value, updated_at = now()
FROM (VALUES
    (12464, 2, 1980, 8420, 400),
